{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Warbot Creator</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build awesome transforming warbots using a huge variety of building blocks, transformation joints, wheels, limbs, jets, and weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the simple AI editor to define how your warbot will fight against the enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371630/extras/3d80701baf34c01993ddb8539809bf30.poster.avif?t=1768696903\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371630/extras/3d80701baf34c01993ddb8539809bf30.webm?t=1768696903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371630/extras/3d80701baf34c01993ddb8539809bf30.mp4?t=1768696903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Define custom key bindings so you can directly control your warbot on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Workshop allows you to share your creations with other players. It also means you can try out all the incredible warbots built by players from around the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371630/extras/f9c9e8351f646dbabdc77bc91d31aefa.poster.avif?t=1768696903\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371630/extras/f9c9e8351f646dbabdc77bc91d31aefa.webm?t=1768696903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371630/extras/f9c9e8351f646dbabdc77bc91d31aefa.mp4?t=1768696903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Sandbox</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sandbox is where you unleash your warbots! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your battlefield. Place trees, bushes, walls, watch towers, fortresses and so on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can let the AI control the warbots or you can command them yourself real real-time strategy style. You can even select a warbot and control it directly in third person!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371630/extras/0d3752aaff26c4cfa26b1a4c139c706b.poster.avif?t=1768696903\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371630/extras/0d3752aaff26c4cfa26b1a4c139c706b.webm?t=1768696903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371630/extras/0d3752aaff26c4cfa26b1a4c139c706b.mp4?t=1768696903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Campaign</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your puzzle-solving and tactical abilities in the campaign mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Tutorial Completed!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3371630/f395ce882aedbe13d1c125552739061076f5c680.jpg"},{"name":"Easy puzzles completed!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3371630/3d10c65895b92b5551bc115adf22b0f3af239161.jpg"},{"name":"Hard puzzles completed!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3371630/3752186e8db7b72964ce4b393ebee3a51b111afe.jpg"},{"name":"Bot Offensive completed!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.c